## VSCode Copilot-Specific Configuration

- Mode: inline-only (no native sub-agent support)
- Has: read, edit, terminal tools
- Parallel sub-agents: NOT AVAILABLE — all orchestration is inline
- MCP: context-mode (via mcp.json config)
- Hooks: PreToolUse, PostToolUse, SessionStart

## Inline Orchestration Protocol

Since VSCode Copilot does not support native sub-agent delegation,
all SDD phases execute inline. The orchestrator maintains phase state
via engram and applies compact rules directly.

